      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
        <div class="footer-grid">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
              <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-[var(--lime)]" style="box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--lime);"></span>
              <span class="text-base font-bold">claude-multi</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-sm text-[var(--text-mute)] max-w-xs leading-relaxed">
              One CLI to manage every Claude Code instance — Anthropic, GLM, MiniMax, DeepSeek. Isolated configs, synced plugins, zero conflict.
